{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"2-chronicles 26:11","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"de","chapter":26,"translation":"Und Usija ⟨hatte⟩ eine kriegstüchtige Streitmacht, die zum Heer ausrückte, in Abteilungen, nach der Zahl ihrer Musterung, unter der Hand des Jeëljel, des Schreibers, und des Maaseja, des Beamten, ⟨eingeteilt⟩ unter der Hand des Chananjahu, ⟨einem⟩ von den Obersten des Königs.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויהי","gloss":"und ⟨es⟩ war"},{"surface":"לעזיהו","gloss":"dem Usija"},{"surface":"חיל","gloss":"eine Streitmacht"},{"surface":"עשה","gloss":"die führt"},{"surface":"מלחמה","gloss":"Krieg"},{"surface":"יוצאי","gloss":"ausrückende"},{"surface":"צבא","gloss":"zum Heer"},{"surface":"לגדוד","gloss":"in Abteilungen"},{"surface":"במספר","gloss":"nach der Zahl"},{"surface":"פקדתם","gloss":"ihrer Musterung"},{"surface":"ביד","gloss":"unter der Hand"},{"surface":"יעואל","gloss":"Jeëljel"},{"surface":"הסופר","gloss":"des Schreibers"},{"surface":"ומעשיהו","gloss":"und Maasejas"},{"surface":"השוטר","gloss":"des Beamten"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"unter"},{"surface":"יד","gloss":"der Hand"},{"surface":"חנניהו","gloss":"des Chananjahu"},{"surface":"משרי","gloss":"von den Obersten"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"des Königs"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T00:00:01.679800488Z","model":"glm-5.2"}